          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ശബ്ദം — śabdaṁ — \"a sound; a voice\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "രാത്രി അടുക്കളയിൽ ഒരു ശബ്ദം കേട്ടു. rātri aṭukkaḷayil oru śabdaṁ kēṭṭu. At night a sound was heard in the kitchen."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a voice: അവളുടെ ശബ്ദം (śabdaṁ), her voice."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ശബ്ദം (śabdaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit śabda, \"an articulate sound, a noise\" (CDIAL 12298)."
            }
          ]
        },
